https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dujanhung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3914135156","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3914135156"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-09T09:40:18Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3915275116,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pXlts","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3915275116","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3915275116"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-09T13:06:15Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3918752138,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pk2mK","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally with a mix of CSG nodes, MeshInstance3Ds, Decals and Marker3Ds, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- It's possible to enable vertex snapping while dragging gizmos or using Blender-style manipulation shortcuts. However, it has no visible effect other than drawing the yellow circle gizmo around a vertex.\r\n\r\n- It should be possible to release <kbd>B</kbd> after starting a dragging operation, so you don't have to keep it held down the whole way. Right now, releasing <kbd>B</kbd> while dragging will stop moving the selected node (but won't cancel the operation).\r\n\r\n- The vertex snap gizmo could be drawn twice (once opaque with normal depth, once translucent with depth test disabled), so that you can be aware that you're snapping to a vertex that is occluded by another object:\r\n\r\nCurrent | Proposed (mockup)\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"215\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2eda389f-2d4e-42d9-836e-da73d9c7c136\" /> | <img width=\"215\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b32518eb-628e-4b0b-94b6-0e3cfb34674a\" />\r\n\r\nWe use the same trick for the 3D selection box, so it appears translucent when occluded.\r\n \r\n- Non-geometry nodes like Decal, ReflectionProbe and Marker3D behave a bit oddly. You can enable vertex snapping and move the node according to the snapped vertex, but the node won't center around the vertex like one would probably expect. Instead, it will move relative to your mouse movement, taking the snapped vertex into account.\r\n  - I can't think of a lot of use cases for this, so I think it would make more sense to move the node's origin to the snapped vertex instead. This makes sense for Marker3D nodes in particular, which may be used as \"shot origins\" on weapon models, characters, etc.\r\n\r\n- Out of curiosity, is edge/face snapping planned in the future?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3918752138","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3918752138"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-09T23:11:04Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3921402756,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7pu9uE","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3921402756","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3921402756"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-10T10:35:45Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3924271118,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7p56AO","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now 🙂 \n\nSome more feedback:\n\n- The gizmo will display at the wrong position until you move the mouse when teleporting a Marker3D node through vertex snapping:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1296d6af-a238-46b6-9b3c-5a969cfdc91c\n\n- The gizmo displays at a very low opacity when occluded. I'd increase it a little, as it's hard to see right now, especially behind complex geometry or textures.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3924271118","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3924271118"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-10T17:43:04Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3925796225,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7p_uWB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I did some more testing with nested node trees, instanced scenes, etc. I've also checked the vertex snap behavior at various editor scales and it behaves as expected.\r\n\r\nI've also tested vertex snapping in complex scenes like https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection and performance seemed OK. I do wonder if there's room for improvement on performance still, as dragging a mesh with vertex snapping is clearly less smooth the more complex the scene gets.\r\n\r\nHowever, on https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo, it gets very slow when using vertex snap because the scene geometry is pretty complex (less than 1 FPS). We should probably have an option to snap using collision data instead of visual mesh data, as it's much simpler in this scene. Maybe we should do this automatically for meshes that are under a PhysicsBody3D parent?\r\n\r\nCode looks good to me.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3925796225","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3925796225"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-10T22:23:48Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3933081330,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7qbg7y","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now. The performance level is much more practical on the TPS demo as well as Reflection now, at least when using an optimized editor build (`production=yes lto=full`). On a debug build with `optimize=none`, it's still pretty slow on the TPS demo, but it's usable on Reflection.\n\nI noticed that using vertex snap to move a node does not reset the follow mode (like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117289 did for other transforms). It should do that as well. Perhaps starting a vertex snap operation while in follow mode should cancel the follow mode too, as it often behaves erratically due to the sudden teleportation.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3933081330","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3933081330"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-11T23:24:37Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3948607209,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7rWvbp","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Code and functionality seem good.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3948607209","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117235#pullrequestreview-3948607209"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117235"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-14T10:23:19Z","commit_id":"331541b25af890a14e19095f4213ca47e0b17122"}]